        "title": "You feel like you are out of place here - amazing to see it however",
        "text": "You get the feeling that you should not be here from the moment you arrive, what is worse is when you take out your camera in some other worldly fascination to capture the scene and show everyone at home what you witnessed. \n\nThe Hindu priests (called Bhattas) can be seen walking around the complex, do not (unless you want to at lease) make eye contact or take their picture without permission, they do not take kindly to this. If you want a picture simply offer them some Rupees and they will be more than happy to pose. \n\nProbably my highlight from Kathmandu, a must see in my opinion to all visitors of the city.",
